<title>UK: OPEC basket price rose to $18.53 on Friday.</title>
<headline>OPEC basket price rose to $18.53 on Friday.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The price of OPEC's basket of seven crudes rose to $18.53 a barrel on Friday from $18.49 on Thursday, the OPEC news agency said on Monday, quoting the OPEC Secretariat.</p>
<p>The basket comprises Algeria's Saharan Blend, Indonesia's Minas, Nigeria's Bonny Light, Saudi Arabia's Arabian Light, Dubai of the UAE, Venezuela's Tia Juana and Mexico's Isthmus.</p>
